<title>HUNGARY: World Bank extends $225 mln loan to Hungary - MTI.</title>
<headline>World Bank extends $225 mln loan to Hungary - MTI.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The World Bank and Hungary concluded an agreement on a $225 million loan, the Hungarian MTI news agency said on Monday.</p>
<p>MTI said that the loan would finance reforms in Hungary's business and monetary sectors.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327 4040</p>
</text>
